  size           String?   // ׳׳™׳“׳” - numeric size from barcode
  isTaken        Boolean   @default(false) // ׳ ׳׳§׳— - was the item physically taken
  isReturned     Boolean   @default(false) // ׳”׳•׳—׳–׳¨ - was the item returned
  returnedOk     Boolean   @default(false) // ׳—׳–׳¨_׳×׳§׳™׳ - returned in good condition
  takenDate      DateTime? // ׳×׳׳¨׳™׳_׳׳§׳™׳—׳”
  returnDate     DateTime? // ׳×׳׳¨׳™׳_׳”׳—׳–׳¨׳”
  isDeleted      Boolean   @default(false) // ׳׳—׳•׳§ - soft delete
  deletedAt      DateTime? // ׳×׳׳¨׳™׳_׳׳—׳™׳§׳”
  
  // Alteration tracking (׳×׳™׳§׳•׳ ׳™׳)
